%% Agent run with live box and follow-up. Invariants I2 and I3 from the planning basis,
%% flow per 04-sync-protocol.md sections 11 and 15. Paths without version prefix.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as App Alex, thread in focus
  box api node
    participant MSG as messaging
    participant RU as runs
    participant GW as gateway (agent connection, hub)
  end
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AD as Agent adapter
  participant LZ as Agent runtime

  A->>MSG: POST message with a mention of the operator
  MSG->>MSG: authorize(Alex, message.create, thread)
  MSG->>DB: BEGIN, thread sequence, INSERT message (origin human)
  MSG-)RU: in-tx event MessagePosted
  RU->>RU: authorize(Alex, agent.invoke, thread): trigger, operator, mention rule, I2 pre-check
  RU->>DB: INSERT runs (queued), anchor message kind run, trigger_state queued
  RU->>DB: events message.created, run.state_changed, agent.invocation (to the agent, without token)
  MSG->>DB: finalize event_seq, COMMIT
  MSG-->>A: 201, trigger_state queued
  DB--)GW: NOTIFY, log tail reads
  GW-->>A: dispatch message.created, run.state_changed queued
  GW->>RU: PrepareDelivery(agent.invocation)
  RU->>RU: authorize(Alex, agent.invoke) with current permissions, I2 again
  RU->>DB: sign invocation token (JWS, EdDSA), set runs.invocation_jti
  GW-->>AD: dispatch agent.invocation with token
  AD->>AD: signature via JWKS, aud, reported mode equals billing_mode (I3), tool class at most tool_class
  AD->>AD: event and token into the inbox
  AD->>GW: ack (seq), acknowledged after acceptance
  opt token expired
    AD->>RU: POST runs/{id}/invocation-token (old token), checks as before the delivery
    RU-->>AD: fresh token
  end
  AD->>RU: POST runs/{id}/start (token, billing_mode_used, tool_class_used, external_session_ref)
  RU->>DB: check jti, expiry and tool class, CAS queued to running, trigger_state working
  RU-->>AD: 200 running
  GW-->>A: dispatch run.state_changed running, message.updated working
  AD->>LZ: start turn
  loop throttled to agent.run_update_min_interval
    LZ-->>AD: tool, status line, text
    AD->>GW: op run.update (run_id, base_version, ops)
    GW->>RU: apply patch: CAS on runs.version, store without event_log
    RU-)GW: ephemeral run.updated
    GW-->>A: run.updated, coalesced per sync.run_patch_coalesce_interval
  end
  opt recipient on another api node
    RU-)DB: NOTIFY ephemeral (run_id, version), only IDs
    Note over GW: The other node loads the run document and sends run.updated with snapshot
  end
  A->>MSG: POST follow-up in the same thread
  MSG-)RU: in-tx event MessagePosted
  RU->>DB: active run exists: run_followups queued, agent.followup
  MSG-->>A: 201
  GW->>RU: PrepareDelivery(agent.followup): agent.invoke and I2, new token
  GW-->>AD: dispatch agent.followup with token
  AD->>LZ: feed in follow-up (steer or queue)
  AD->>GW: run.update followups/{message_id} delivered
  RU->>DB: trigger_state followup_delivered, event message.updated
  AD->>GW: run.update followups/{message_id} absorbed
  LZ-->>AD: answer and costs
  AD->>MSG: POST reply message (origin agent, triggers nothing)
  AD->>RU: run.finish completed, with metrics and costs
  RU->>DB: CAS running to completed, summary, cost_entries (estimate), trigger_state done
  GW-->>A: message.created, run.state_changed completed: live box collapses to one line
